{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_033_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:058fcfee33d268fd497932f7f7e1b91faf8c3efe20c567a347456e9bfff988fe",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_23:5_01_033_23_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0df39146e128c4b05d42f48734362219214856dccd7830b76f073df4782e9cd",
      "text": "从●●●●プロデューサー那里收到的巧克力，\n看起来超级美味！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_23:5_01_033_23_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6020066080d87c5447cac77b30600bac35c36fceafa1113ad697ba9d3cd8b26",
      "text": "谢啦，制作人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_23:5_01_033_23_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:425202f67c45143bc1d76bafc6c12e76418d7a72dab7018fb5f3c046335b0d65",
      "text": "嘿嘿。还有我从家里带来的零食，\n今天的休息时间真是让人期待啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_23:5_01_033_23_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e8a18c68ec3905504f7a2c0012bb56e5bfd66e5c6fb05b19713b138e87da2ba",
      "text": "你能喜欢真是太好啦！\n练习也要加油哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_23:5_01_033_23_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98092427a70ba133015b14b73914742a2a47c4693d37037e5f7800ad27e4fb49",
      "text": "噢！包在我身上啦！\n……啊，对了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_23:5_01_033_23_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f39ab6658f57a9d3abc400ac5625e173d327b9b05baa1c2362dac013b098fb0",
      "text": "给，这个！\n我的零食，也分给制作人一些吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_23:5_01_033_23_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e4d69e6b38f4dc420d6a592ef26a40149933655c406267053eb9f7555167ffd",
      "text": "咦，真的可以吗？\n这不是志狼君为了自己吃带过来的吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_23:5_01_033_23_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a8f681b3a18fc9b85483a1a8f847bc41792bf13be650fafe74fd7e87500ee83",
      "text": "没事啦没事啦！\n正因为是情人节才给你的特别福利哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_23:5_01_033_23_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:906e8c1e4a8cfdddd30723c3dbe6140f84b14ab37aa85126a29208d71752dc03",
      "text": "啊，对花音他们要保密哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_23:5_01_033_23_a:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c41affadcda6bf19f377424cd6cefcea8a3f4856da5585d0677a1eaee5ca3e2",
      "text": "那么，我就恭敬不如从命了……\n谢谢你，志狼君！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
